2
00:04:48,700 --> 00:04:52,300
放て！心に刻んだ夢を
Fire away! Leave behind the dreams engraved in your heart

3
00:04:52,300 --> 00:04:55,600
未来さえ置き去りにして
Leaving even the future behind

4
00:04:55,600 --> 00:04:58,800
限界など知らない 意味無い！
Knowing no limits, they're meaningless!

5
00:04:58,800 --> 00:05:02,000
この能力が光散らす
This power scatters the light

6
00:05:01,608 --> 00:05:02,408
散らす
...radiate.

7
00:05:02,408 --> 00:05:07,908
その先に遥かな想いを
Radiating these distant feelings into the future...

8
00:05:10,208 --> 00:05:13,608
歩いてきたこの道を
On this path I've walked,

9
00:05:13,608 --> 00:05:16,608
振り返ることしか
if the only thing I can do

10
00:05:16,608 --> 00:05:18,908
出来ないなら...
is look back...

11
00:05:18,908 --> 00:05:23,108
今ここで全てを壊せる
I can destroy everything right here and now.

12
00:05:23,408 --> 00:05:26,508
暗闇に堕ちる街並み
The cityscape descends into darkness.

13
00:05:26,508 --> 00:05:30,108
人はどこまで立ち向かえるの？
How far can people stand and fight?

14
00:05:30,308 --> 00:05:33,508
加速するその痛みから
From this accelerating pain,

15
00:05:33,508 --> 00:05:37,408
誰かをきっと守れるよ
I'm sure I can protect someone.

16
00:05:37,608 --> 00:05:40,708
Looking! The blitz loop this planet to search way.
Looking! I'll blitz loop this planet to search for a way.

17
00:05:40,708 --> 00:05:43,508
Only my RAILGUN can shoot it.

18
00:05:43,608 --> 00:05:48,608
今すぐ 身体中を 光の速さで
Right now, running through my body at the speed of light,

19
00:05:48,608 --> 00:05:51,408
駆け巡った 確かな予感
is a definite premonition.

20
00:05:51,408 --> 00:05:55,008
掴め！望むものなら残さず
Grab it! Leave nothing behind if it's what you desire,

21
00:05:55,008 --> 00:05:59,208
輝ける自分らしさで
with a shining individuality.

22
00:05:59,208 --> 00:06:02,208
信じてるよ あの日の誓いを
I believe in the vow made that day.

23
00:06:02,208 --> 00:06:05,008
この瞳に光る涙
Even the tears shining in these eyes

24
00:06:05,008 --> 00:06:10,108
それさえも強さになるから
will turn into my strength!

25
00:06:12,408 --> 00:06:15,608
立ち止まると 少しだけ
When I stop, just a little bit,

26
00:06:15,608 --> 00:06:18,608
感じる切なさに
at the painful sadness I feel,

27
00:06:18,608 --> 00:06:22,108
戸惑う事無いなんて
I won't lie and say

28
00:06:22,108 --> 00:06:25,108
嘘はつかないよ
that I'm never confused.

29
00:06:25,608 --> 00:06:28,408
宙に舞うコインが描く
The parabolic arc drawn by a coin flipped in the air

30
00:06:28,408 --> 00:06:31,608
放物線が決める運命
will decide our fate.

31
00:06:31,808 --> 00:06:35,308
打ち出した答えが今日も
The answer shot forth rushes through

32
00:06:35,308 --> 00:06:38,808
私の胸を駆け巡る
my chest again today.

33
00:06:39,808 --> 00:06:42,908
Sparkling! The shiny lights awake true desire.
Sparkling! The shiny lights awaken true desire.

34
00:06:42,908 --> 00:06:45,808
Only my RAILGUN can shoot it.

35
00:06:45,808 --> 00:06:49,608
必ず 貫いてく 途惑うことなく
I'll pierce through without fail, without hesitation.

36
00:06:49,608 --> 00:06:53,608
傷ついても 走り続ける
Even if I get hurt, I'll keep running!

37
00:06:53,608 --> 00:06:56,608
狙え！凛と煌めく視線は
Take aim! The cold, glittering gaze

38
00:06:56,608 --> 00:07:00,108
狂い無く闇を切り裂く
tears through the darkness without straying.

39
00:07:00,108 --> 00:07:03,408
迷いなんて 吹き飛ばせばいい
Just blow away all hesitation.

40
00:07:03,408 --> 00:07:07,108
この心が叫ぶ限り
As long as my heart cries out,

41
00:07:07,108 --> 00:07:11,108
誰ひとり邪魔などさせない
I won't let anyone get in my way!

42
00:07:40,408 --> 00:07:43,908
儚く舞う無数の願いは
Countless fleetingly dancing wishes

43
00:07:43,908 --> 00:07:47,108
この両手に積もっていく
gather in both of my hands.

44
00:07:47,108 --> 00:07:50,408
切り裂く闇に見えてくるのは
What comes into view through the piercing darkness

45
00:07:50,408 --> 00:07:53,808
重く深く切ない記憶
are heavy, deep, and painful memories.

46
00:07:53,808 --> 00:07:57,108
色褪せてく現実に揺れる
Trembling in a fading reality,

47
00:07:57,108 --> 00:08:00,608
絶望には負けたくない
I don't want to lose to despair.

48
00:08:00,608 --> 00:08:03,908
私があれ私であること
Being who I am right now,

49
00:08:03,908 --> 00:08:07,408
胸を張って全て誇れる！
I can hold my head high and be proud of it all!

50
00:08:07,408 --> 00:08:10,608
Looking! The blitz loop this planet to search way.
Looking! I'll blitz loop this planet to search for a way.

51
00:08:10,608 --> 00:08:13,408
Only my RAILGUN can shoot it.

52
00:08:13,408 --> 00:08:18,408
今すぐ 身体中を 光の速さで
Right now, running through my body at the speed of light,

53
00:08:18,408 --> 00:08:21,008
駆け巡った 確かな予感
is a definite premonition.

54
00:08:21,008 --> 00:08:24,108
放て！心に刻んだ夢を
Fire away! The dreams engraved in your heart,

55
00:08:24,108 --> 00:08:27,608
未来さえ置き去りにして
leaving even the future behind!

56
00:08:27,608 --> 00:08:31,608
限界など知らない 意味無い！
Knowing no limits—it's meaningless!

57
00:08:31,608 --> 00:08:33,908
この能力が光散らす
This power radiates light...

58
00:08:33,908 --> 00:08:39,608
その先に遥かな想いを
sending distant feelings far beyond!

59
00:09:21,808 --> 00:09:24,408
突然降る夕立
A sudden evening downpour...

60
00:09:24,408 --> 00:09:27,108
あぁ 傘もないや 嫌
Ah, I don't even have an umbrella, I hate this!

61
00:09:27,608 --> 00:09:31,608
空のご機嫌なんか知らない
I don't care about the mood of the sky.

62
00:09:31,808 --> 00:09:34,608
季節の変わり目の服は
What am I supposed to wear

63
00:09:34,608 --> 00:09:37,408
何着りゃいいんだろ
when the seasons change?

64
00:09:37,608 --> 00:09:41,608
春と秋どこいっちゃったんだよ
Where did spring and autumn go?

65
00:09:41,808 --> 00:09:44,108
息も出来ない
I can't even breathe...

66
00:09:44,108 --> 00:09:46,608
情報の圧力
overwhelmed by information.

67
00:09:46,808 --> 00:09:49,108
めまいの螺旋だ
It's a spiral of dizziness.

68
00:09:49,108 --> 00:09:51,408
わたしはどこにいる
Where am I?

69
00:09:51,608 --> 00:09:54,408
こんなに こんなに
Even though my breathing

70
00:09:54,408 --> 00:09:57,408
息の音がするのに
sounds so loud, so loud...

71
00:09:57,608 --> 00:10:01,608
変だね 世界の音がしない
It's strange, I can't hear the sound of the world.

72
00:10:02,196 --> 00:10:04,696
しない 足りない 足りない
Not enough, not enough,

73
00:10:04,696 --> 00:10:07,096
誰にも気づかれない
no one notices me.

74
00:10:07,096 --> 00:10:10,696
殴り書きみたいな音 出せない状態で叫んだよ
I screamed while unable to make even a rough scribble of a sound.

75
00:10:10,696 --> 00:10:15,896
「ありのまま」なんて 誰に見せるんだ
"Just as I am"—who am I supposed to show that to?

76
00:10:15,896 --> 00:10:22,096
馬鹿なわたしは歌うだけ
So a fool like me can only sing.

77
00:10:22,096 --> 00:10:25,596
ぶちまけちゃおうか 星に
Shall I blurt it all out to the stars!

78
00:10:36,096 --> 00:10:42,396
エリクサーに張り替える作業も なんとなくなんだ
Changing to Elixir strings felt kind of aimless too.

79
00:10:42,396 --> 00:10:46,396
欠けた爪を少し触る
Caress my chipped fingernail a bit.

80
00:10:46,396 --> 00:10:52,396
半径300mmの体で 必死に鳴いてる
Desperately crying out with a body radius of 300 mm.

81
00:10:52,396 --> 00:10:56,596
音楽にとっちゃ ココが地球だな
For music, this right here is Earth.

82
00:10:56,596 --> 00:11:01,396
空気を握って 空を殴るよ
Clench the air and punch the sky.

83
00:11:01,396 --> 00:11:06,396
なんにも起きない わたしは無力さ
Nothing happened, I was helpless.

84
00:11:06,396 --> 00:11:11,596
だけどさ その手で この鉄を弾いたら
But if I pluck this steel string with that hand,

85
00:11:11,596 --> 00:11:17,096
何かが変わって見えた...ような。
I felt like something changed... it seemed like.

86
00:11:17,096 --> 00:11:21,096
眩しい 眩しい そんなに光るなよ
So bright, so bright, don't shine so dazzlingly.

87
00:11:21,096 --> 00:11:26,596
わたしのダサい影が より色濃くなってしまうだろう
My lame shadow will only grow even darker.

88
00:11:26,596 --> 00:11:31,396
なんでこんな熱くなっちゃってんだ 止まんない
Why did I get so fired up? It won't stop!

89
00:11:31,396 --> 00:11:36,396
馬鹿なわたしは歌うだけ
So a fool like me can only sing.

90
00:11:36,396 --> 00:11:41,596
うるさいんだって 心臓
Shut up, heart!

91
00:11:49,396 --> 00:11:59,396
蒼い惑星 ひとりぼっち いっぱいの音を聞いてきた
Alone on a blue planet, I've listened to so many sounds.

92
00:11:59,396 --> 00:12:09,596
回り続けて 幾億年 一瞬でもいいから...あぁ
It keeps spinning for hundreds of millions of years, even for a moment... ah.

93
00:12:09,596 --> 00:12:12,596
聴いて 聴けよ
Hear it, listen to me.

94
00:12:12,596 --> 00:12:16,596
わたし わたし わたしはここにいる
I, I, I am right here!

95
00:12:16,596 --> 00:12:21,596
殴り書きみたいな音 出せない状態で叫んだよ
I screamed while unable to make even a rough scribble of a sound.

96
00:12:21,596 --> 00:12:26,596
なんかになりたい なりたい 何者かでいい
I want to become something, I want to be someone, anyone!

97
00:12:26,596 --> 00:12:31,396
馬鹿なわたしは歌うだけ
So a fool like me can only sing.

98
00:12:31,396 --> 00:12:36,096
ぶちまけちゃおうか 星に
Shall I blurt it all out to the stars!

99
00:13:04,096 --> 00:13:08,396
歌聴いてくれてありがとう！
Thank you so much for listening to my song!

100
00:13:08,396 --> 00:13:15,796
聴いてくれるこの環境、とっても嬉しく思いま...
Having this environment where everyone listens to me makes me so happy...

101
00:13:15,796 --> 00:13:23,796
いやぁ、おさらいするのもね、もうかなり難しくて、練習頑張ったんで、どうだったかな？
Man, even practicing it was pretty tough, but I worked really hard on it! How was it?

102
00:13:23,796 --> 00:13:28,096
よかったー！嬉しいー！
Thank goodness! I'm so happy!

103
00:13:28,096 --> 00:13:34,796
あっ、ホロライブ4期生、角巻わためでーす！
Ah, I'm Tsunomaki Watame from Hololive 4th Generation!

104
00:13:34,796 --> 00:13:43,096
これみよがしに弾いていまーす！今日でなんと！9歳になりましたー！
I'm showing off my playing! And today, I turned 9 years old!

105
00:13:43,096 --> 00:13:48,596
いやお祝いいっぱい、ありがとう！ありがとうございます！
Thank you so much for all the birthday wishes! Thank you so much!

106
00:13:48,596 --> 00:14:01,396
いや、この日のために、もうたくさんたくさん頑張って準備もしてきたので、ぜひ最後まで見て楽しんでほしいなと思います！
I worked really, really hard preparing for this day, so I hope you'll watch and enjoy until the very end!

107
00:14:01,396 --> 00:14:03,596
よろしくベイベー！
Nice to meet you, baby!

108
00:14:03,596 --> 00:14:08,596
ということでね、これは片付けますね。もう使わないのでね。
So with that, I'll put this away now. I won't be using it anymore.

109
00:14:08,596 --> 00:14:19,596
はい、ちょっと待っててね。よいしょ、よいしょ。このギターが...ふぅ...オッケー！
Okay, please wait a sec. Ups-a-daisy. Ups-a-daisy. This guitar... phew... Okay!

110
00:14:19,596 --> 00:14:25,596
ふぅー、肩こりになっちまう。よいしょ。
Phew, my shoulders are getting stiff. There we go.

111
00:14:25,596 --> 00:14:30,596
いや、待っててくれてありがとうございます！
Thank you so much for waiting!

112
00:14:30,596 --> 00:14:35,096
今日のハッシュタグはなんと前代未聞！
Today's hashtag is truly unprecedented!

113
00:14:35,096 --> 00:14:47,596
こちら、「角巻わため生誕祭2025」なので、こちらのハッシュタグをつけて、たくさんポストしていただけると嬉しいです！
It's "Tsunomaki Watame Birthday Festival 2025", so I'd be so happy if you posted a lot with this hashtag!

114
00:14:47,596 --> 00:14:52,596
今日はアニソンNight Fever! 楽しんでいけますかー？！
Today is Anison Night Fever! Are you ready to have fun?!

115
00:14:52,596 --> 00:14:54,796
いけますかー？！
Are you ready?!

116
00:14:54,796 --> 00:14:58,596
わためは、いけますー！
Watame is ready!

117
00:14:58,596 --> 00:15:04,596
では、アニソンNight Fever! 行くぞー！
Then, Anison Night Fever! Let's go!

118
00:15:05,577 --> 00:15:06,277
ん？
Huh?

119
00:15:06,477 --> 00:15:07,977
なんだこれはい？
What is this?

120
00:15:08,777 --> 00:15:12,477
こんなのステージに置いてあったらいけないでしょ！
You can't just leave something like this on stage!

121
00:15:12,777 --> 00:15:14,077
つぎにー！
Next...

122
00:15:14,277 --> 00:15:15,477
何これ？
What is this?

123
00:15:15,777 --> 00:15:19,677
ん？何なの？誰こんなん置いたの？ん？
Huh? What is it? Who left this here? Huh?

124
00:15:20,477 --> 00:15:22,577
なんじゃこりゃー！
What on earth is this?!

125
00:15:47,077 --> 00:15:54,777
このままもう少し歩こう 肩を抱き
Let's walk a little further like this, shoulder to shoulder,

126
00:15:55,077 --> 00:16:03,477
消えゆく夢を数え 枯れてく仲間を見た
counting fading dreams, watching friends wither away.

127
00:16:03,777 --> 00:16:11,477
通い慣れた道に迷い込む このごろ
Lately, I've been getting lost on familiar roads,

128
00:16:11,777 --> 00:16:19,777
闇がもう一人の自分をつくる
and the darkness creates another version of myself.

129
00:16:20,077 --> 00:16:28,277
渇いた叫びが くじけそうな胸を突き刺す
A thirsty cry pierces my heart that feels ready to break.

130
00:16:28,677 --> 00:16:35,477
君を誘って世界を見たいな
I want to invite you along to see the world.

131
00:16:35,977 --> 00:16:44,777
だれにも出せない答えが僕の中にある
Inside of me lies an answer that no one else can reach.

132
00:16:45,177 --> 00:16:48,577
駆け引きがカギ
Haggling strategy is the key,

133
00:16:48,877 --> 00:16:54,977
とどけ fly at higher game
reach out and fly at a higher game.

134
00:17:04,977 --> 00:17:12,477
いくつの悲しみを一緒に越えただろう？
How many sorrows have we overcome together?

135
00:17:12,777 --> 00:17:20,477
気が済むまで求めたあの日の僕達がいた
Back then, we sought answers until our hearts were satisfied.

136
00:17:20,977 --> 00:17:28,677
時代が巡るなら またどこかで会えるね
If time comes full circle, we'll meet again somewhere.

137
00:17:28,977 --> 00:17:35,977
その時が来るまで 諦めない
Until that moment comes, I won't give up.

138
00:17:36,277 --> 00:17:45,477
冷めてく想いは どうしても否めないけど
Though I can't deny that my feelings are cooling down,

139
00:17:45,777 --> 00:17:52,377
恋に落ちて変わってくのもいいね
falling in love and changing isn't so bad either.

140
00:17:53,777 --> 00:18:01,977
焦らず 騒がず あるがままでと願うから
Without rushing or panicking, I pray for things to be as they are,

141
00:18:02,177 --> 00:18:05,677
心に話を
so with flowers in our hearts,

142
00:18:05,977 --> 00:18:11,977
咲かそう just take my heart
let's make them bloom, just take my heart.

143
00:18:36,977 --> 00:18:45,477
渇いた叫びが くじけそうな胸を突き刺す
A thirsty cry pierces my heart that feels ready to break.

144
00:18:45,777 --> 00:18:52,477
君を誘って世界を見たいな
I want to invite you along to see the world.

145
00:18:53,477 --> 00:19:02,477
だれにも出せない答えが夢の中にある
Inside a dream lies an answer that no one else can reach.

146
00:19:02,777 --> 00:19:06,477
僕を信じて
Believe in me,

147
00:19:06,777 --> 00:19:10,477
咲かそう just take my heart
let's make them bloom, just take my heart,

148
00:19:10,777 --> 00:19:17,477
人生は続いてく
for life keeps going on.

149
00:20:23,452 --> 00:20:28,152
明日へ続く坂道の途中で
On the way up the slope leading to tomorrow,

150
00:20:28,152 --> 00:20:32,852
すれ違う大人たちはつぶやくのさ
the adults passing by murmur:

151
00:20:34,252 --> 00:20:39,052
「愛とか夢とか理想も分かるけど
"I understand about love, dreams, and ideals,

152
00:20:39,052 --> 00:20:44,652
目の前の現実そんなに甘くない」って
but reality right now isn't that sweet."

153
00:20:44,852 --> 00:20:50,452
つまづきながらも 転がりながらも
Stumbling along, rolling along,

