00:33:26,255 --> 00:33:28,555
誰の記憶から消えてしまっても
Even if it fades from everyone's memory

338
00:33:28,555 --> 00:33:30,755
私がい未来に連れて行くから
I will carry it with me into the future

339
00:33:30,755 --> 00:33:32,955
君の手を取った
I took your hand

340
00:33:32,955 --> 00:33:35,255
あの日に全て始まった
And that day everything began

341
00:33:35,255 --> 00:33:37,555
くだらなくて
It was trivial, and

342
00:33:37,555 --> 00:33:39,755
思わずふっと笑ってしまうような
Unintentionally made me chuckle

343
00:33:39,755 --> 00:33:41,955
ありふれた時間が今も眩しい
Those ordinary moments are still radiant now

344
00:33:41,955 --> 00:33:43,955
知りたいんだ
I want to know

345
00:33:43,955 --> 00:33:46,255
今更だって
Even at this late hour

346
00:33:46,255 --> 00:33:48,555
振り返るとそこにはいつでも
Whenever I look back, you're always there

347
00:33:48,555 --> 00:33:50,755
優しく微笑みかける
Smiling gently at me

348
00:33:50,755 --> 00:33:53,255
君がいるから
Because you are there

349
00:34:01,255 --> 00:34:03,755
新たな旅の始まりは
The beginning of a new journey

350
00:34:03,755 --> 00:34:06,255
君が守り抜いたこの地に
In this land you protected

351
00:34:06,255 --> 00:34:12,755
芽吹いた命と共に
Together with the sprouting life

352
00:34:29,255 --> 00:34:32,755
勇者、いい曲だったねー！
"Yuusha" was a great song, wasn't it?

353
00:34:32,755 --> 00:34:35,255
うんー！
Yeah!

354
00:34:35,555 --> 00:34:40,255
VJとかもね、あ、VJっていうのはこの後ろのMVのことなんだけど
The VJ work too—ah, VJ refers to the MV playing behind me—

355
00:34:40,255 --> 00:34:44,255
VJとかもね、こだわって見たので
We put a lot of care into the VJ visuals as well,

356
00:34:44,255 --> 00:34:46,755
ぜひぜひいっぱい見てもらいたいな
so I really hope you'll watch it a lot!

357
00:34:46,755 --> 00:34:48,555
アーカイブとかもね！まだ終わってないけどね！
In the archives too! Though the stream isn't over yet!

358
00:34:48,555 --> 00:34:51,755
ゲストさんもいっぱい来てくれて嬉しいよー！
I'm so happy so many guests came to join me!

359
00:34:51,755 --> 00:34:53,955
ありがとー！
Thank you!

360
00:34:54,755 --> 00:34:56,555
なんかさー
You know...

361
00:34:56,555 --> 00:34:58,755
今までのセトリさ、あの平成の...
Our setlist so far, like, filled with Heisei...

362
00:35:00,136 --> 00:35:01,136
...とか
...or something.

363
00:35:01,136 --> 00:35:04,636
ま、令和のアニソンとかを盛り込んでみたんだけど
Well, I tried to include some Reiwa anime songs,

364
00:35:04,636 --> 00:35:07,136
知ってる曲はありましたか？
did you recognize any of them?

365
00:35:07,136 --> 00:35:10,336
お気に入りの曲とかあったかな〜？
Did you have any favorites?

366
00:35:10,636 --> 00:35:15,136
なんか好きな曲とか、もし見つかったりしたら教えてほしいなと思います。
If you found any songs you liked, I'd love for you to tell me.

367
00:35:15,136 --> 00:35:18,636
この曲良かったよーとか教えてください！
Please let me know if there were any songs you enjoyed!

368
00:35:18,936 --> 00:35:22,136
あ、今コメントで教えてくれてもいいんだよ〜
Ah, you can even tell me in the comments right now~

369
00:35:22,136 --> 00:35:23,936
うんうんうんうん
Mm-hmm, yeah...

370
00:35:24,136 --> 00:35:25,236
でーもー！
But!

371
00:35:25,336 --> 00:35:28,336
これで終わりじゃないんだよね！
This isn't the end yet!

372
00:35:28,636 --> 00:35:30,636
1曲だけ...
Just one song...

373
00:35:30,936 --> 00:35:35,636
ま、この後ちょっとゲームの曲とかもなんか混ざってんだけど
Well, after this, there are even some game songs mixed in,

374
00:35:35,636 --> 00:35:40,136
あの、コンセプトがあるセトリになってます、この後！
but the upcoming setlist has a clear theme!

375
00:35:40,336 --> 00:35:43,936
探してみてもらえると嬉しいです！
I'd love it if you try to figure it out!

376
00:35:44,136 --> 00:35:47,936
ゲストさんもね、まだ出ていない人もいるので
Also, there are still guests who haven't appeared yet,

377
00:35:47,936 --> 00:35:50,136
楽しみにしててくださーい！
so look forward to it!

378
00:35:50,136 --> 00:35:51,636
はーい！
Yay!

379
00:35:51,936 --> 00:35:53,636
よーし
Alright...

380
00:35:54,136 --> 00:35:56,636
では、聴いてください。
Now then, please listen.

381
00:35:01,187 --> 00:35:01,276
止まらない未来を目指して
Aiming for an unstoppable future,

382
00:36:14,936 --> 00:36:28,136
ゆずれない願いを抱きしめて
embracing an unyielding wish.

383
00:36:36,336 --> 00:36:40,936
海の色が紅く染まってゆく
The color of the sea turns crimson,

384
00:36:40,936 --> 00:36:43,436
無重力状態
weightless...

385
00:36:43,636 --> 00:36:48,936
このまま風にさらわれたい
I want to be swept away by the wind like this.

386
00:36:49,136 --> 00:36:52,436
いつも跳べないハードルを
I've always cleared unjumpable hurdles

387
00:36:52,436 --> 00:36:54,936
負けない気持ちで
with an undefeatable spirit,

388
00:36:54,936 --> 00:36:57,736
クリアしてきたけど
but...

389
00:36:57,936 --> 00:37:01,936
出し切れな実力は
The potential I couldn't fully unleash,

390
00:37:01,936 --> 00:37:06,136
誰のせい？
whose fault is it?

391
00:37:06,336 --> 00:37:13,936
止まらない未来を目指して
Aiming for an unstoppable future,

392
00:37:14,136 --> 00:37:20,136
ゆずれない願いを抱きしめて
embracing an unyielding wish,

393
00:37:20,336 --> 00:37:24,936
色褪せない心の地図
the unfading map of my heart,

394
00:37:25,136 --> 00:37:30,136
光にかざそう
let me hold it up to the light!

395
00:37:33,636 --> 00:37:38,936
どれだけ泣けば 朝に出会えるの
How much do I have to cry until I meet the morning?

396
00:37:39,136 --> 00:37:46,636
孤独な夜 初めて限界を感じた日
On a lonely night, the day I first felt my limits...

397
00:37:46,936 --> 00:37:50,136
きっと恋に落ちるのは
Surely, falling in love is like a blink,

398
00:37:50,136 --> 00:37:52,336
まばたきみたいな
a passion of a single moment,

399
00:37:52,336 --> 00:37:55,636
一瞬の情熱だけど
but...

400
00:37:55,936 --> 00:37:59,636
愛に続く坂道で
On the slope that leads to love,

401
00:37:59,636 --> 00:38:03,936
強さ覚えたい
I want to learn true strength.

402
00:38:04,136 --> 00:38:11,436
止まらない未来を夢見て
Dreaming of an unstoppable future,

403
00:38:11,636 --> 00:38:14,136
口を閉ざし
I kept my mouth closed

404
00:38:14,136 --> 00:38:18,636
瞳を光らせてきたけれど
and let my eyes shine, but...

405
00:38:18,736 --> 00:38:27,636
もっと大きな優しさが見えた
I was able to see an even greater kindness.

406
00:38:45,936 --> 00:38:48,136
跳べないハードルを
Hurdles I couldn't jump,

407
00:38:48,136 --> 00:38:50,636
負けない気持ちで
with an undefeatable spirit,

408
00:38:50,636 --> 00:38:53,136
クリアしてきたけど
I've cleared them, but...

409
00:38:53,336 --> 00:38:57,636
スタートラインに立つたびに
Every time I stood at the starting line,

410
00:38:57,636 --> 00:39:01,636
怯えていた
I was frightened.

411
00:39:01,936 --> 00:39:08,936
止まらない未来を描いて
Picturing an unstoppable future,

412
00:39:09,136 --> 00:39:12,636
腕を伸ばし
reaching out my arms

413
00:39:12,636 --> 00:39:16,136
心を開いて
and opening my heart...

414
00:39:16,336 --> 00:39:23,936
止まらない未来を目指して
Aiming for an unstoppable future,

415
00:39:24,136 --> 00:39:31,136
ゆずれない願いを抱きしめて
embracing an unyielding wish,

416
00:39:31,336 --> 00:39:36,636
色褪せない心の地図
the unfading map of my heart,

417
00:39:36,936 --> 00:39:44,136
光にかざそう
let me hold it up to the light!

418
00:40:23,951 --> 00:40:28,651
胸に こみ上げてく
Welling up inside my heart,

419
00:40:28,651 --> 00:40:34,451
熱く 激しい この想い
this burning, intense passion...

420
00:40:35,151 --> 00:40:40,351
僕らは行く 最後の戦場へ
We are heading to the final battlefield.

421
00:40:40,751 --> 00:40:46,351
手を取り合い 誓い合って
Joining hands and swearing to each other,

422
00:40:46,951 --> 00:40:51,151
明日の夜明け前に
before tomorrow's dawn,

423
00:40:51,151 --> 00:40:57,451
あの宇宙へと 旅立つのさ
we will depart into that outer space.

424
00:40:57,951 --> 00:41:03,651
僕らが地球にいたことだけ
Just the fact that we were here on Earth,

425
00:41:04,151 --> 00:41:09,651
どうか 覚えていて欲しいよ
please, I just want you to remember.

426
00:41:10,151 --> 00:41:12,651
振り返るな
Don't look back,

427
00:41:12,651 --> 00:41:15,151
涙を見せるな
don't show your tears!

428
00:41:15,151 --> 00:41:17,951
I GET THE POWER OF LOVE

429
00:41:18,151 --> 00:41:22,651
明日を取り戻すんだ
We will take back our tomorrow!

430
00:41:23,151 --> 00:41:26,651
(WO WOH WOH)

431
00:41:26,951 --> 00:41:29,651
GONG 鳴らせ!!
Sound the GONG!!

432
00:41:30,151 --> 00:41:35,651
今こそ 立ち上がれ 運命の戦士よ
Now is the time! Rise up, warriors of fate!

433
00:41:36,151 --> 00:41:41,351
稲妻の剣で 敵を蹴散らせ
Scatter the enemy with lightning swords!

434
00:41:41,951 --> 00:41:47,151
安らぎを夢見る 鋼の勇者よ
Steel heroes who dream of peace!

435
00:41:47,651 --> 00:41:52,951
守るべき未来と 愛を信じて
Believe in love and the future you must protect!

436
00:41:53,151 --> 00:41:59,151
永遠へ!
To eternity!

437
00:42:14,651 --> 00:42:16,351
もしも
Even if...

438
00:42:16,351 --> 00:42:24,951
力尽きて 闘志の刃砕けても
our strength runs out and our blade of fighting spirit breaks,

439
00:42:25,151 --> 00:42:30,651
僕らは二度と戻らない
we will never turn back.

440
00:42:31,151 --> 00:42:36,651
ともに銀河の海に散ろう
Let us perish together in the sea of the galaxy.

441
00:42:37,151 --> 00:42:39,651
恐れるな
Do not fear,

442
00:42:39,651 --> 00:42:42,351
誇りを捨てるな
do not throw away your pride!

443
00:42:42,351 --> 00:42:45,351
I GET THE POWER OF LOVE

444
00:42:45,651 --> 00:42:50,151
さぁ 迷わず行くんだ!
Now, move forward without hesitation!

445
00:42:50,151 --> 00:42:54,151
(WO WOH WOH)

446
00:42:54,351 --> 00:42:57,151
GONG 鳴らせ!!
Sound the GONG!!

447
00:42:57,651 --> 00:43:02,951
雄々しく舞い踊れ 運命の戦士よ
Bravely dance, warriors of fate!

448
00:43:03,351 --> 00:43:08,651
金色の翼で 天に羽ばたけ
Soar to the heavens on golden wings!

449
00:43:09,151 --> 00:43:14,651
退くことを知らない 鋼の勇者よ
Steel heroes who know no retreat!

450
00:43:15,151 --> 00:43:20,151
燃えたぎるソウルの 命ずるままに
As your burning soul commands!

451
00:43:20,351 --> 00:43:27,151
永遠へ!
To eternity!

452
00:43:28,151 --> 00:43:39,151
(WO WOH WOH)

453
00:44:07,151 --> 00:44:11,651
GONG GONG GONG 鳴らせ!!
Gong, gong, sound the GONG!!

454
00:44:12,151 --> 00:44:17,651
今こそ 立ち上がれ 運命の戦士よ
Now is the time! Rise up, warriors of fate!

455
00:44:18,151 --> 00:44:23,351
稲妻の剣で 敵を蹴散らせ
Scatter the enemy with lightning swords!

456
00:44:23,951 --> 00:44:29,151
安らぎを夢見る 鋼の勇者よ
Steel heroes who dream of peace!

457
00:44:29,651 --> 00:44:34,951
守るべき未来と 愛を信じて
Believe in love and the future you must protect!

458
00:44:35,151 --> 00:44:41,151
永遠へ!
To eternity!

459
00:45:23,606 --> 00:45:26,206
君は聴こえる？
Can you hear it?

460
00:45:26,206 --> 00:45:29,206
僕のこの声が
This voice of mine

461
00:45:29,206 --> 00:45:34,806
闇に虚しく 吸い込まれた
Was emptily sucked into the darkness

462
00:45:34,806 --> 00:45:39,806
もしも世界が 意味を持つなら
If the world has meaning,

463
00:45:39,806 --> 00:45:44,906
こんな気持ちも 無駄ではない？
Are these feelings not in vain?

464
00:45:44,906 --> 00:45:50,906
憧れに押しつぶされて あきらめてたんだ
Crushed by longing, I had given up,

465
00:45:50,906 --> 00:45:56,406
果てしない空の色も 知らないで
Without even knowing the color of the endless sky.

466
00:45:56,406 --> 00:46:01,306
走り出した 想いが今でも
I started running, and these feelings, even now,

467
00:46:01,306 --> 00:46:07,206
この胸を確かに 叩いてるから
Are definitely pounding in my chest.

468
00:46:07,206 --> 00:46:12,606
今日の僕が その先に続く
The me of today continues beyond,

469
00:46:12,606 --> 00:46:18,106
僕らなりの明日を築いていく
Building our own tomorrow.

470
00:46:18,106 --> 00:46:25,606
答えはそう いつもここにある
The answer, yes, is always right here.

471
00:46:36,506 --> 00:46:41,806
過ぎた季節を 嘆く暇はない
There's no time to mourn the seasons that have passed,

472
00:46:41,806 --> 00:46:47,306
二度と迷って しまわぬように
So that I'll never lose my way again.

473
00:46:47,306 --> 00:46:58,206
数えきれない ほんのささやかな そんな後悔 抱えたまま
Holding onto countless, tiny regrets like that,

474
00:46:58,206 --> 00:47:03,706
その背中だけ追いかけて ここまで来たんだ
Chasing only after your back, I've come this far.

475
00:47:03,706 --> 00:47:09,306
探していた 僕だけにできること
Searching for what only I can do.

476
00:47:09,306 --> 00:47:14,806
あの日くれた 言葉が今でも
The words you gave me that day, even now,

477
00:47:14,806 --> 00:47:20,506
この胸に確かに 届いているから
Definitely reach my heart.

478
00:47:20,506 --> 00:47:25,906
昨日よりも 今日僕は僕の
Today, more than yesterday,

479
00:47:25,906 --> 00:47:31,206
生まれてきた理由に気付いていく
I'm realizing the reason I was born.

480
00:47:31,206 --> 00:47:39,106
答えはそう いつもここにある
The answer, yes, is always right here.

481
00:47:48,406 --> 00:47:51,406
ハイ！ハイ！ハイ！ハイ！
Hey! Hey! Hey! Hey!

482
00:47:52,906 --> 00:47:54,906
ライブ楽しいねー！
Concerts are so much fun!

483
00:47:57,306 --> 00:47:59,606
ハイ！ハイ！ハイ！もういっちょ！
Hey! Hey! Hey! One more time!

484
00:48:05,106 --> 00:48:07,606
みんなありがとう！
Thank you, everyone!

485
00:48:10,406 --> 00:48:15,806
全てがまるで
Everything was as if

486
00:48:15,806 --> 00:48:21,106
当たり前みたいだった
It was completely taken for granted.

487
00:48:21,106 --> 00:48:25,906
尊い日々は まだ終わらない
Those precious days aren't over yet,

488
00:48:25,906 --> 00:48:31,906
そしてまた
And then again...

489
00:48:31,906 --> 00:48:37,306
走り出した 想いが今でも
I started running, and these feelings, even now,

490
00:48:37,306 --> 00:48:43,006
この胸を確かに 叩いてるから
Are definitely pounding in my chest.

491
00:48:43,006 --> 00:48:48,406
今日の僕が その先に続く
The me of today continues beyond,

492
00:48:48,406 --> 00:48:53,906
僕らなりの明日を築いていく
Building our own tomorrow.

493
00:48:53,906 --> 00:49:03,106
答えはそう いつもここにある
The answer, yes, is always right here.

494
00:49:31,206 --> 00:49:33,106
みんなー！
Everyone!

495
00:49:33,306 --> 00:49:36,306
ギリギリのロボ、カッコよかったー？
Was Girigiri Robot cool?

496
00:49:36,806 --> 00:49:39,906
ロボット乗って飛んじゃったよー！
I rode a robot and flew!

497
00:49:40,506 --> 00:49:44,006
すごい！カッコよかったよねー！
Awesome! That was so cool, right?

498
00:49:44,106 --> 00:49:49,906
いやー、この3曲はロボットの曲をテーマに
Man, these three songs were themed around robot songs,

499
00:49:49,906 --> 00:49:53,706
歌って踊らせていただきましたー！
and I got to sing and dance to them!

500
00:49:53,706 --> 00:49:56,706
さらにゲストもね、たくさん出演してくれて
And we had so many guests join us too,

501
00:49:56,706 --> 00:49:59,606
本当にありがとう！嬉しい！
so thank you so much! I'm so happy!

502
00:50:00,187 --> 00:50:01,987
はい、ありがとうございます！
Thank you so much!

503
00:50:01,987 --> 00:50:03,687
感謝です！
I'm so grateful!

504
00:50:03,687 --> 00:50:08,687
あ、そういえば、この頃... この頃... みんな気づいたかなあ...
Ah, by the way, recently... Did everyone notice?

505
00:50:08,687 --> 00:50:14,687
この頃最初から実はそうだったんだけど、あの小顔ローラー頑張りまして...
Well, actually right from the start, I've been working hard with a face roller...

506
00:50:14,687 --> 00:50:18,687
実わわたし、小顔になったんですよ、ねえ。
To tell you the truth, Watame's face got smaller, you know?

507
00:50:18,687 --> 00:50:20,687
こう見えて...
Believe it or not...

508
00:50:20,687 --> 00:50:26,187
もうあれだね、「顔デカい」って言われなくなっちゃうなーみんな！
Now nobody can call me "big face" anymore!

509
00:50:26,187 --> 00:50:27,687
めんごめんご！
Sorry, sorry!

510
00:50:27,687 --> 00:50:34,187
そんな変わってないって言わない！言わない！ちゃんと小さくなったの！
Don't say it hasn't changed much! It really did get smaller!

511
00:50:34,187 --> 00:50:41,687
あ、この後ね、メン限3Dライブも22時15分からわためチャンネルでやりますので...
Ah, after this, the members-only 3D live will be on Watame Channel from 22:15...

512
00:50:41,687 --> 00:50:46,687
他の衣装のね、この小顔のわためも見てほしいなと思います。
So I hope you'll check out this small-faced Watame in other outfits too.

513
00:50:46,687 --> 00:50:54,187
歌って踊りますので、ぜひ22時15分メンバーシップに入ってお待ちくだい！
I'll sing and dance, so please join the membership and wait for 22:15!

514
00:50:54,187 --> 00:50:59,187
でも！まだライブも終わりではありません！
But! The live stream isn't over yet!

515
00:50:59,187 --> 00:51:02,687
ここで告知があります！
I have an announcement right here!

516
00:51:02,687 --> 00:51:07,687
角巻わための新曲...
